# Circuit build intermediates: large and fully reproducible from build.mjs.
# The wasm, the final zkey and the verification key ARE committed, so the demo
# and CI can prove and verify without a circom toolchain.
# The repo-wide `build/` rule (above) would swallow these, so they are
# un-ignored explicitly and the large intermediates re-ignored after.
!circuits/build/
circuits/build/*
!circuits/build/verification_key.json
!circuits/build/reconciliation.zkey
!circuits/build/reconciliation_js/
circuits/build/reconciliation_js/*
!circuits/build/reconciliation_js/reconciliation.wasm

# Circuit artifacts are copied into the web app's public/ by its prebuild step.
# The source of truth is circuits/build/ — keeping a second copy in version
# control would let the deployed prover drift from the committed circuit.
packages/web/public/zk/
